## Test-authored bounded original business sequence: create Run, append counted Turn, return Run.
app CreatedPair
Given
 Conversation {title:text}
 Branch in Conversation {title:text}
 Run in Branch {marker:int}
 Turn in Branch {position:int min=1,run:Run}
 policy Conversation read=members
 policy Branch read=members
 policy Run read=members
 policy Turn read=members
When
 scenario append(branch:Branch) by=members -> Run
  do
   create Run {parent=branch,marker=0} as run
   create Turn {parent=branch,position=count(branch.Turn)+1,run} as turn
   return run
Then
